rt the fight with 20% more HP.","La première attaque du combat est toujours un coup critique.":"The first attack of the fight is always a critical hit.","Le héros subit 10 % de dégâts en moins.":"The hero takes 10% less damage.","Les objets de soin et les bombes sont 25 % plus efficaces.":"Healing items and bombs are 25% more effective.","L'attaque touche toujours, même un ennemi caché.":"The attack always hits, even a hidden enemy.","Les soins du héros rendent 15 % de PV en plus.":"The hero's heals restore 15% more HP.","Sang de dragon donne son plein effet dès 50 % de PV.":"Dragon Blood takes full effect from 50% HP.","Refrain dure 1 tour de plus.":"Refrain lasts 1 more turn.","Une fois par combat, relève un allié K.O. avec 30 % de ses PV.":"Once per fight, revives a KO'd ally with 30% of their HP.","Chaque ennemi vaincu par le porteur lui rend 10 % de ses PV max.":"Each enemy defeated by the wearer restores 10% of their max HP.","Les coups critiques infligent × 2 au lieu de × 1,5.":"Critical hits deal × 2 instead of × 1.5.","25 % de chances de tirer une seconde flèche sur un autre ennemi.":"25% chance to fire a second arrow at another enemy.","Les tirs ignorent 30 % de la défense et des résistances de la cible.":"Shots ignore 30% of the target's defence and resistances.","Les compétences coûtent 20 % de mana en moins.":"Skills cost 20% less mana.","Commun":"Common","Peu commun":"Uncommon","Épique":"Epic","Légendaire":"Legendary","Mythique":"Mythic","les épées":"swords","les armes à deux mains":"two-handed weapons","les masses":"maces","les dagues":"daggers","les arcs":"bows","les arbalètes":"crossbows","les bâtons":"staves","les sceptres":"sceptres","les orbes":"orbs","les instruments":"instruments","les armures lourdes":"heavy armour","les armures intermédiaires":"medium armour","les tenues légères":"light outfits","les boucliers":"shields","les carquois":"quivers","les sacoches":"satchels","cet objet":"this item","bonus réduits de moitié":"bonuses halved","Cet 